ers so I do not expect the  judge to be  terribly lenient with mr. Weinstein it's  unclear if Weinstein plans to speak at  his sentencing we know that his lawyer  said that he will appeal this verdict  and remember Harvey Weinstein is still  facing charges in Los Angeles it is  unclear when the district attorney plans  to move forward in that case Anthony  Jericka thank you
 

